{"assertionId":"83fa28d4-eb94-4a9f-95ac-ab9983e90dc4","entityBindings":[],"fragments":[{"exactText":"Each test includes a simple finger-stick blood collection that takes approximately 3 minutes. Patients follow the enclosed instructions and return their sample via USPS drop-off using the prepaid materials provided.","fragmentId":"sha256:7969ed8c9960cb2ed2bfa3b13d67b382ca55b00109e62859b56d58e93539a7e5"}],"proposition":"Each test includes a simple finger-stick blood collection that takes approximately 3 minutes. Patients follow the enclosed instructions and return their sample via USPS drop-off using the prepaid materials provided.","qualifiers":[],"rubricVersion":"evidence-only.v1"}